        "# Bayesian Inference\n",
        "\n",
        "## Synthetic 'Simplest case'\n",
        "\n",
        "## Sydney Radar\n",
        "\n",
        "The Sydney Radar Dataset (from ...) is a good example of a spatially invariant kernel IDEM (where flow is consistant across space).\n",
        "\n",
        "The example is explored [here](./Sydney_Radar.html).\n",
        "\n",
        "# Other\n",
        "\n",
        "## Non-IDEM filtering\n",
        "\n",
        "While the filters in `jaxidem` are built for filtering IDEMs, we can use the filtering techniques for general Dynamic Linear Models.\n",
        "A simple tracking example is given [here](./filtering_and_smoothing.html)"
